# The repository's top-level .gitignore excludes `dist/` anywhere in the tree,
# which is right for build output and wrong for this one directory: everything
# under linux/helper/dist is hand-written source that gets installed on the
# user's machine (the polkit policy, the systemd unit, the bus policy, the udev
# rules, and the install/uninstall scripts the app runs through pkexec). Nothing
# here is generated.
!dist/
